0 KineBrick corrections to the connection table
0 // Snap lines for what neither the LDraw parts nor the LDCad shadow library describe.
0 // Each "0 FILE" block applies to one part, after that part's shadow lines.
0 // Same syntax as the LDCad shadow library, plus one extra section shape: T, a tyre seat.

0 FILE 3482.dat
0 // Wheel Rim 8 x 17.5 with Axlehole: tyre seat around its outside, 20 LDU wide
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=M] [caps=none] [secs=T 22 20] [center=true] [ori=1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0]

0 FILE 3483.dat
0 // Tyre 56 x 17 Offset Tread: sits on a 22 LDU radius rim seat, 18 LDU wide
0 !LDCAD SNAP_CYL [gender=F] [caps=none] [secs=T 22 18] [center=true] [ori=1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0]
